    "directions": [
      "In a mixing bowl season lamb with salt, black pepper, 2 tbsp. curry powder, ginger, dried thyme, paprika, onions, garlic, spring onions, scotch bonnet. cover then marinate for a few hours.",
      "Brown the meat in a pan with oil for around 10 minutes and mix.",
      "Then add 250ml of water, cover and cook on a medium heat for up to an hour until meat is tender.",
      "Stir every 15 minutes and add the remaining 250ml of water halfway through.",
      "Add your potatoes and cook until tender.",
      "Serve with Rice, fried plantain and steamed cabbage."
    ],
